{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "58ec63a1d5e2d11c17e052f0c257a58b7662320716364437ac05c914be851977", "ja": "Empathy ～違う自分を～", "zh": "Empathy ～不一样的自己～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3e8008d746cb09c2b1631cc425f52d351bafd21c47febdf41602e97c240409e2", "ja": "求人情報誌の会社から、CMのオファーが。\nメンバーは雪歩、千鶴、律子、恵美の4人。\nテーマは、『仕事で、違う自分になる！』。\nそれぞれギャップのある職種に挑戦する事に\nなり、気合いを入れるのだった。", "zh": "招聘信息杂志的公司发来了广告邀约。\n成员是雪步、千鹤、律子、惠美共4人。\n主题是“通过工作，成为不同的自己！”。\n大家决定分别挑战与自身反差十足的职业，于是都鼓足了干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "364a942392e66eacf288bb4e0173bd4a6109c435bfa3c1d48895c3cf5f9cebc8", "ja": "（求人情報誌の会社から、CM出演のオファーが来た。\nアイドルが様々なアルバイトに挑戦する内容だ）", "zh": "（求人杂志公司发来了出演广告的邀约。\n内容是让偶像们挑战各种各样的兼职。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0023449637a4ffe50a2d69e5dfa1e74b1a7ae587a104988569967db630a69c3e", "ja": "（出演メンバーには、雪歩と千鶴さんも選ばれた。\n新曲のお披露目公演も近いし、いい宣伝になるぞ！）", "zh": "（雪步和千鹤也被选为出演成员。离新歌的首次公演也不远了，肯定能成为很好的宣传！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0b71487dc932f78beb73b8764a92194214552d79a66190d685677b30291b9a4b", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。この求人情報誌って、\n駅とかに置いてある雑誌ですよね？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。这种求职信息杂志，\n就是放在车站之类地方的杂志吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "cd5882c9c6be7dccc0b84f38eeb37345deceb708388bd62bea337f2929d7f69b", "ja": "わたくしも知っていますわ。たしかスーパーにも\n置いてある……と、知人が言っていましたわ！", "zh": "我也知道哦。这种杂志超市里好像也有……听熟人说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "276e2857b0759872230ad3320f19cd7d0424d487460c1678f97254f3ea20897a", "ja": "ここのCM、たまに見るけど面白いよね～。\nけどバイトって、どんなことするんだろ？", "zh": "这里的广告我偶尔会看到，挺有意思的对吧～  \n不过，所谓打工，究竟是做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4ec383e1bcea93e4517c7e7daee471d1db3d53e7910ce7195faec25e49ac32a7", "ja": "なんでも、本人のイメージとは違う仕事に挑戦するが\nコンセプトらしい。台本が届いてるから、配るよ。", "zh": "听说主题是挑战与本人形象不符的工作。剧本已经送到了，我发给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "c6e6a5b2880caefccded3d4b5fa098e13103e3ed1ee9929bc4fb5fd2ecbdb427", "ja": "テーマは『仕事で、違う自分になる！』ですか。\nなるほど、けっこう面白そうですね。", "zh": "主题是“在工作中，成为不同的自己”吗？\n原来如此，感觉还挺有意思的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "d1986d93a709485a4b8dd91a2ca882bfffd829b2c15e6bf1bd63424ce1800a27", "ja": "わたくしと雪歩ちゃんの新曲も普段とは違うアプローチ\nですものね。タイアップにピッタリかもしれませんわ。", "zh": "我和雪步的新歌也采用了不同于平时的方式，或许会非常适合这次合作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ed2e1790edcd0c56a32373c2cff6500852c4663cc93b46398a20cf8f6b215159", "ja": "そうですね。ふたりのパフォーマンス向上にも\n繋がる、いいチャンスになると思います。", "zh": "是啊，我觉得这也是提升我们两人表现力的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "00360cd40e76491b18e343d9b7e233f63daeb473261e74815be27ff7aa3656ca", "ja": "パフォーマンス向上……そ、そうですよね。\n千鶴さん、あの、がんばりましょう……！", "zh": "提升表现……对、对吧。\n千鹤小姐，那个，我们一起加油吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "b0d3708cef62b6b03e7eeca2113abd6433c2de2b974284fcf9d089d1a6d764a8", "ja": "もちろんですわ！\n最高のCMにしてみせますわよ！", "zh": "那是当然！\n我一定会让它成为最棒的广告给您瞧瞧的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8af2f5f809ec616ad0a27e9d700724e6bf00f5cc671331cb2962cfda9f48ec65", "ja": "それじゃ、一人ずつ配役の確認ですが……\n千鶴さんは、スーパーのレジ係、ですね。", "zh": "那么，我们来逐一确认角色分配……\n千鹤小姐饰演超市收银员，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "a75170dfd5bc4075ffaa1066c00e54784b44313342bee2579bbf8f6540e414f8", "ja": "『地元商店街のスーパーで働く、庶民派大学生』……\nた、たしかに普段のわたくしとは違いますわね！", "zh": "“在当地商店街的超市工作的、平民派大学生”……\n确、确实和我平时的形象不一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "25477a9a28501964963403e2419385ac811373d44ca42776dc020baaddcc32f6", "ja": "恐らく監督が、千鶴さんのイメージとは\n真逆の設定を付けたんでしょうね。", "zh": "恐怕是导演给千鹤小姐安排了与她平时形象完全相反的设定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d8fb71c537f5a04b5dac6cb3f008aa235c6bced37b48fa3ae77dc7f193a7c525", "ja": "けどこれも、普段と違う一面を見せるという意味では、\n新曲に向けたいい練習の場になるかもしれません。", "zh": "不过，从展现与平时不同的一面这一点来说，这也许会成为为新歌做准备的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "0f3e6249e965e5b26df09ce8aa754dc0a0cf65c78c26d6a8c121b8842e498841", "ja": "庶民派大学生の千鶴さん……。\nビックリするくらい、ギャップがありますね。", "zh": "平民派大学生的千鹤……\n反差大得真让人吃惊呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "7466b01928e9c0aecb30ee6856241cffc7c931f1dab7aaae48b1b183ae732ffd", "ja": "そ、そうですわね！？　なるほど、わかりましたわ！\n普段とは縁遠いイメージ、ですものね！", "zh": "是、是这样呢！？原来如此，我明白了！毕竟，这是和我平时相去甚远的形象嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "b70c2455a75481518bc62bdabda4c71cd273d1c13a01312d1259e7e75bacf881", "ja": "雪歩はオシャレなコーヒーショップの店員さんだって。\nおお～いいじゃ～ん！　バリスタだよ、バリスタ！", "zh": "听说雪步是时髦咖啡店的店员。哦～不错嘛～！是咖啡师哦，咖啡师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2453be03775940bdb70249427a2932bf08ebf87277d35073975a1a7fbbb8e538", "ja": "う、うん……でもコーヒーショップって、\nいろんなお客さんと話さないと、だよね……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……可是咖啡店的话，\n就得和形形色色的客人说话了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d20766e6b1c23f833d4a4f174ff9b879cbb8182f4e56c03d9afa78d05546c7b8", "ja": "お、男の人のお客さんもいるだろうし……\nううっ、わ、私、ちゃんとできるのかなぁ……？", "zh": "而、而且肯定也会有男客人……\n呜呜，我、我真的能做好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "478d5cd84a2d0296c6bf4c49d570e59d32888420e51c6ec47a8e95f16a149c18", "ja": "そうだな。けど撮影だし、こうして台本も\n段取りもある。心配しなくて大丈夫だ。", "zh": "是啊。不过毕竟是拍摄，台本和流程都已经安排好了。不用担心，没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "085bd40626a1a773e5d3afc879101813cdfad7a17117d30e579a70c65f63c7bd", "ja": "{$P$}……そ、そうですよね。\n私、がんばります……！", "zh": "{$P$}……对、对啊。\n我会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "4bc625e513296830bbb0b109b1eb6a5314365163c980e1a5fbf8597e7f2a9ee9", "ja": "千鶴さんはスーパー、雪歩はカフェときて……\n私は、アパレルショップのカリスマ店員、ですか。", "zh": "千鹤是超市，雪步是咖啡馆，而……\n我是服装店的王牌店员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "2a91d368eb70aa609292b3947c66c07d32bd292e56f59d171044f05bee8716f9", "ja": "洋服センスに、自信があるわけじゃないですけど、\nでも、なんだか面白そうですね！", "zh": "我也不是对服装品味有多大自信，不过，总觉得挺有意思的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "ca498ba43371067a01e62e1bbbf2245eb7f8e003d62acc64008b77614c2300c9", "ja": "最後がアタシだね！　えっと……わっ！\nアタシ、これすっごい得意かも！？", "zh": "最后轮到我了！呃……哇！\n我好像超擅长这个的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "3e6284b2090deea725f629ea00715d05fa765ecc8f09d2436fce68febffba94e", "ja": "そうなんですの？　恵美のお仕事は……\n飲食店のデリバリー業務……？", "zh": "是这样吗？　惠美的工作是……\n餐饮店的外送工作……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "9ff817b70dc481ad6a4165e5c2e88f54c474526f03ae1c37f05e0a9b0f448895", "ja": "アタシ、チャリには自信あるんだよね！\n学校行くのも、駅まではチャリだし♪", "zh": "我对骑自行车可是很有自信的！\n就连上学，我也是骑车到车站的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "bfdab6e9c5c03462b5754f553d41808fc9e0f2772d0945fa85190e3509e33192", "ja": "アイドル始めてからますます体力ついたし、\nどこまでだって運んじゃうよ～！　にゃはは。", "zh": "开始当偶像以后，体力变得更好了，\n不管多远我都能骑过去哦～！呀哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a5ab422bd4da2904d6a2b73c58b41f48ac53f394732a68fc794bff0f79596950", "ja": "なるほど……。けど、こういうのって、\n自転車じゃなくてバイクを使うんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此……不过，这种事不该骑自行车，而是要骑摩托车吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "370b35d560fc093c636f545b92a0aec6a60a4969b6b34bf981fe7003f856ea5e", "ja": "えっ、そうなの？　{$P$}、\nアタシ免許持ってないよ？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？{$P$}，我可没有驾照哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "afbbf2f0b08fe705b0bae0b4939f8c7ca0fe0c826b3507279cf1fd0cccfff7c6", "ja": "最近だと、自転車で配達するデリバリーも\n多いみたいですけどね。", "zh": "不过最近好像也有很多是骑自行车送餐的外卖呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a279b8d36066b8b8c563aaccecb63c08a8425c3c063e55b5e17f396d2308d8f", "ja": "ホントに！？　よかった～。……あれ？\nでもアタシだけ、なんかギャップなくない？", "zh": "真的！？太好了～。……咦？不过，怎么好像只有我没什么反差啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8cd918b222d82a1fd421266e448e33298f04755652487c19913bd11e43c80eff", "ja": "世間的には、元読モのアイドルが自転車通学って、\nだいぶイメージと違うと思うけどな……。", "zh": "在大家看来，曾经当过读者模特的偶像居然骑自行车上学，应该和印象中的形象差得挺多吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "49fd8bd28fc182914aa4661483b8f11846d100b3bb9405ff0052ac782c483670", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。私のアパレルショップなんかは、\n普段なら恵美の方が適任だと思いますし。", "zh": "呵呵，确实如此。要说我的服装店之类的，我平时也觉得还是惠美更合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5da44b1bed1a4555557715a8d0bfdfcc51984256e80bac85ae8af26716472f8a", "ja": "律子さんが選んでくれる服……\nちょっと、お願いしてみたいかも……？", "zh": "律子选的衣服啊……\n我好像……也有点想拜托看看了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "81d81783aed7d24f651547df8d7c8246877fd7d736498b29557abf46acc561b0", "ja": "今からプレッシャーかけないでよ、雪歩……\nまあその辺りは、指示があると思うけどね。", "zh": "现在就别给我施加压力了，雪步……\n不过那方面应该会有人安排吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "7b2b19614558c6448008671b4f160e9d1536742375e728ecae944712dff81839", "ja": "それぞれ普段とは違うイメージで大変だと思うけど、\nCMは大勢が見るものだからな。頑張ってほしい！", "zh": "虽然对每个人来说，展现与平时不同的形象应该都很辛苦，但广告可是很多人都会看到的。希望你们加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "9139887628a6bcc4f2180a5019d994209b2df669a15b2142cf62b1a4bd6878c1", "ja": "特に千鶴さんと雪歩にとっては、\nデュエットの宣伝にもなりますからね。", "zh": "尤其对千鹤和雪步来说，也能宣传你们的二重唱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1038_004yuk", "source_sha256": "de2e26cc39509363c9ba45a1a2ffcfbaea10ffa76d4318fd7de5372bb42a598a", "ja": "は、はいっ！　今からしっかり台本を読んで、\n練習しておきます！", "zh": "是、是的！我现在就认真读剧本，提前练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1039_038chz", "source_sha256": "68b6fb2e1e7494e56a4feb806d9242658d34573327cbfe71fbca3cd61ec7dc1f", "ja": "わたくしも、さっそく家の手伝いを……ではなく！\nイメージトレーニングをしてまいりますわ！？", "zh": "我也马上就去帮家里做事……不对！我要去进行形象训练了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0154_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0154_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ef3919fabb12b433d0ed2b992f348b3974b264c2b2249ad6dee8a90884c37b76", "ja": "（なかなか面白くなりそうだな。普段と違う自分……\nこの4人なら、きっとうまく演じてくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（感觉会变得相当有趣啊。与平时不同的自己……这4个人一定能演绎得很好的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
